\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9-2 \\\\  & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-11|=11\n$$" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279111 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279112 13194139534153 true] [17592186279111 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534153 true] [17592186279111 1041 "field-1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279111 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279112 13194139534153 true] [17592186279111 1110 #uuid "8bd562a1-de76-57bf-8a2a-0fff1c9df0c4" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279112 1034 "11" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279112 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534153 true] [17592186279112 1111 #uuid "b5401c01-9b40-5421-97da-b5d4e2ef05d1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1017 #edb/ref 17592186279114 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1089 "q-320401" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1100 "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1113 #uuid "6a665495-2aa5-5e3c-af99-7d30a1a81b07" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279113 1145 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot 4-5\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-8-15 \\\\  & =-23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-23\\,|=23\n$$" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279115 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279116 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1041 "field-1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279116 13194139534153 true] [17592186279114 1110 #uuid "d3cd4ea3-2e9a-5c48-9e8a-2b1b46dba0e9" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279115 1034 "7" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279115 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534153 true] [17592186279115 1111 #uuid "2e542d75-809e-5364-be9a-26a2da8cac97" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279116 1034 "23" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279116 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534153 true] [17592186279116 1111 #uuid "da7c3e53-ea11-5924-9681-c7c3af69e697" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1017 #edb/ref 17592186279118 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1089 "q-320553" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1100 "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=⟨-\\frac{4}{3},7⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨a,-9⟩$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1113 #uuid "ec8978a8-907e-5a48-8bc8-078b7ba83da1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279117 1145 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{4}{3} & a \\\\ 7 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{4}{3} & a \\\\ 7 & -9\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-\\frac{4}{3})\\cdot (-9)-a\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =12-7a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12-7a & =0 \\\\ 7a & =12 \\\\ a & =\\frac{12}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279118 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279119 13194139534153 true] [17592186279118 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534153 true] [17592186279118 1041 "field-1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279118 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279119 13194139534153 true] [17592186279118 1110 #uuid "0001203e-7ac4-51ba-958e-a15e910eb722" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279119 1034 "\\frac{12}{7}" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279119 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534153 true] [17592186279119 1111 #uuid "c6eb67d7-299b-5f9f-a3d8-3596447fb4ed" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1017 #edb/ref 17592186279121 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1089 "q-69945" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1100 "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨-1,-2⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨3,6⟩.$" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1113 #uuid "9865b6cc-3075-5d80-85fc-ad172585191d" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279120 1145 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot 6-3\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =-6+6 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279122 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279123 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279124 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279125 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279126 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1041 "selection" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279125 13194139534153 true] [17592186279121 1110 #uuid "b3d6ff9f-7e5b-51a0-ad6c-b7afee4b198e" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279122 1034 "3" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279122 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534153 true] [17592186279122 1111 #uuid "342a9db8-ede7-53d2-b513-4656595af4b5" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279123 1034 "1" 13194139534153 true] [17592186279123 1103 #edb/ref 1759218604545